TECHNICAL REQUIREMENTS
═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

CSS SPECIFICATIONS:
- Mobile-first media queries (base styles mobile, min-width for desktop)
- CSS custom properties (variables) for colors: --primary, --bg, --text, --accent
- Dark mode support: @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) or toggle
- Smooth transitions: 0.3s ease for all interactive elements
- Touch-friendly: min 44px touch targets, readable contrast
- No external CSS frameworks

JAVASCRIPT SPECIFICATIONS:
- Single app object pattern: const SpotAI = { init(), showSection(), quiz{}, etc. }
- Section navigation: Hide all sections, show target (SPA feel)
- Quiz engine: Array of question objects, render function, answer checking
- localStorage: Save quiz progress, high score, tutorial completion
- Image lazy loading: Intersection Observer or native loading="lazy"
- No jQuery, no external JS libraries except Firebase (optional future)

ACCESSIBILITY:
- Semantic HTML5 (nav, main, section, article, button)
- ARIA labels where needed
- Keyboard navigation support (Enter/Space to activate)
- Alt text for every image describing content AND tell (e.g., "AI-generated image showing hand with seven fingers")
- Focus indicators visible

PERFORMANCE:
- Minimize external requests (batch images, use CDNs)
- CSS and JS in external files (cached) but small enough to be fast
- No render-blocking resources

